OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school closes due to road
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school has been closed over
OL,7,Froad safety concerns sparked by the
OL,8,Fremoval of a zebra crossing installed
OL,9,Fincorrectly.
OL,11,FGovernors at Lakenheath Community
OL,12,FPrimary School said there had already
OL,13,Fbeen "several near-miss incidents"
OL,14,Foutside its gates prior to the
OL,15,Fdecision.
OL,17,FIn a statement, they said the closure
OL,18,Fwould provide time for them to speak to
OL,19,FSuffolk County Council about a
OL,20,Fresolution.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
